      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Stéphane will give a technical presentation of &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.globulation2.org/&#34;&gt;Globulation 2&lt;/a&gt;, an open source strategy game.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Stéphane will first present the overall software architecture, the design choices and some philosophical considerations about strategic games and the rationale behind &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.globulation2.org/&#34;&gt;Globulation 2&lt;/a&gt;.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Then he will detail some subsystems of particular interest for the community, such as the GUI, the path-finder, the scripting language and the network. &#xA;He will conclude by a critical analysis of the development process.&#xA;The presentation will save time for questions.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
